{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "e8abec94-90d8-40ad-9750-d0b98e283b26",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3152",
            "content": {
                "en": "It’s the girl who was drumming! Haha, great job out there!",
                "zh": "是敲鼓的小姑娘！哈哈，辛苦了啊！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 9520.7998046875,
            "positionY": 270.3999938964844,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f9039b05-fc52-4703-9729-1b758c7ebd39",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3153",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Ah, so many people are crowding around.)",
                "zh": "（啊，好多人凑过来了。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 9848.0,
            "positionY": 270.3999938964844,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fbbfdc1c-6312-461d-921c-b768b3914700",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3154",
            "content": {
                "en": "You played the drums really well! It’s been a long time since I’ve seen a young person so actively participate in the festival—this makes me so happy!",
                "zh": "小姑娘鼓敲的很好嘛！好久没看到这么积极参与大会的年轻人了！真让人高兴！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 10166.400390625,
            "positionY": 269.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7fa30981-38f2-4c7a-9fac-92cff8703839",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3155",
            "content": {
                "en": "Where are you heading now? If you go right, that’s Jinlan Temple. The awards probably haven’t started yet, but the scenery over there is beautiful!",
                "zh": "你这会儿是要去哪里玩呀？往右边走是金兰观，颁奖应该还没开始，不过那边的风景很好哦！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 10484.7998046875,
            "positionY": 269.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "cab73d8b-964c-4a56-bf6a-923442048b00",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3156",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hey now! Don’t scare the kid—",
                "zh": "嗨呀！你们别吓着这孩子了——",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 10803.2001953125,
            "positionY": 269.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9930da2c-1131-4e5e-9f6d-5d242a00e994",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3157",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Everyone’s a bit too enthusiastic... I should slip away while I can.)",
                "zh": "（大家有点太热情了，我还是趁机溜走吧。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
